<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 15.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 15.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 14.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Prime Credit Tr	 10.21     0.96</p>
<p>2  McIntosh Sec	    10.00     0.90</p>
<p>3  Indu Property	    9.89     0.92</p>
<p>4  Prop Income Inv	  9.77     1.04</p>
<p>5  Villa World		9.65     1.14</p>
<p>6  BT Prop Trust	    9.60     1.70</p>
<p>7  Colonial Mutual	  9.45     1.12</p>
<p>8  Centro Prop		8.74     2.23</p>
<p>9  Aust Tour		  8.72     0.86</p>
<p>10 Central Equity	   8.57     1.05</p>
<p>11 Armstrong Retail	 8.57     0.77</p>
<p>12 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.48     0.92</p>
<p>13 Westpac Prop Tr	  8.47     1.60</p>
<p>14 Gen Prop Tr		8.38     2.40</p>
<p>15 Advance Pro CB	   8.35     1.39</p>
